Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 04:36:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Roll libvpx to 6f89cfbcc9 (as M159), fixing crbug 586941063

Same libvpx revision as branch-heads/8154 5c240af776 ("Cherry-pick libvpx
6f89cfbcc9 to m159"): DEPS, the gitlink, README.chromium and
vpx_version.h. From FlyWeb's a00f6762db (de61454cf8 + 3.1.4 parte6
libvpx/0001 = upstream 0a6d123f0c, already included) to 6f89cfbcc9:
27 upstream commits, including 6f89cfbcc9 "vp9: Fix base_mv usage when
lower SVC layers are skipped" (586941063). libvpx_srcs.gni and the
generated config for mac/x64 and linux/x64 are identical between 8078
and 8154, so nothing is regenerated.

Bug: 586941063
